{"id":"d376cd1568b41e0b","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-local-map.md","title":"Local Map","display":"df-local-map — Local Map","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-local-map","aliases":["58-df-local-map"],"display":"df-local-map — Local Map","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","[[../batch03/58-df-open.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-local-map"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-local-map</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-local-map — Local Map"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ba4e1ea7e4f4dbef\" href=\"?note=ba4e1ea7e4f4dbef\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-open.md\">../batch03/58-df-open.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f,U,X,\\tau_X,Y\\in V\">\\(f,U,X,\\tau_X,Y\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> (function predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Open}_S\">\\(\\operatorname{Open}_S\\)</span> (open-subset predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ba4e1ea7e4f4dbef\" href=\"?note=ba4e1ea7e4f4dbef\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-open.md\">../batch03/58-df-open.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{LocalMap}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{LocalMap}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> (local-map predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}local\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{LocalMap}_S(f,U,X,\\tau_X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Open}_S(U;X,\\tau_X)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,U,Y)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}local\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{LocalMap}_S(f,U,X,\\tau_X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Open}_S(U;X,\\tau_X)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,U,Y)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The open-set call now matches the upstream three-place signature and therefore also verifies <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\subseteq X\">\\(U\\subseteq X\\)</span> and the topology on <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>.</li>\n<li>Local maps are maps defined on neighborhoods or open subdomains.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-open.md","status":"resolved","id":"ba4e1ea7e4f4dbef","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-open.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ (function predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-open.md","status":"resolved","id":"ba4e1ea7e4f4dbef","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Open}_S$ (open-subset predicate, see [[../batch03/58-df-open.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"f,U,X,\\tau_X,Y\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Open}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{LocalMap}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}local\\text{-}map} \\vdash \\mathrm{LocalMap}_S(f,U,X,\\tau_X,Y)\\leftrightarrow\\operatorname{Open}_S(U;X,\\tau_X)\\land\\mathrm{Function}(f,U,Y)","display":true},{"tex":"U\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false}],"bytes":940,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-794","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-local-map.md|58-df-local-map]]（batch13）"}],"outgoing":["36d7463d215be751","ba4e1ea7e4f4dbef"]}